  "comment": "The Network Time Protocol ( NTP ) is a protocol for synchronizing the clocks of computer systems over packet-switched , variable- latency data networks. NTP uses UDP on port 123 as its transport layer . It is designed particularly to resist the effects of variable latency by using a jitter buffer . NTP also refers to a reference software implementation that is distributed by the NTP Public",
